: "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "  Talking About Food"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are several ways to prepare food. When you talk about preparing food, you use <span class =\"strong\"> verbs </span> to talk about the actions you do. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">grill</span>  it (on the barbeque or a small grill at home)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">fry</span>  it (in a pan on the stove)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">boil</span>  it (in water)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">bake</span>   it (in the oven)."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Grilling fish is the best way to prepare it. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I like to fry my fish in garlic and olive oil. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I prefer to bake the fish in the oven with potatoes."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "salmon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of pink fish "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to eat salmon with garlic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use at the fish market."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tilapia "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of white fish with a light taste "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to grill the tilapia."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trout "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a white fish found in fresh water "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer to bake the trout in the oven."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fillet "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of fish with no bones "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think a fillet of salmon is a good idea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "barbecue "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an outside grill   "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The steaks are best on the barbecue."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le11ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the roles below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the situation with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles and practice again"}, {"type": "table", "content": "